title: Kenta_Hangout1
---
Kenta: Hey! You're in my seminar, right? The one who always looks half asleep.
Kenta: I'm collecting Osaka urban legends. Want to hear about the underpass by the river?
-> Sure.
    Kenta: People say if you walk through it at night, you hear bells. In summer. From the far side.
    Kenta: Nobody has walked all the way through. Too dark, they say.
-> I don't believe in that stuff.
    Kenta: That's what everyone says before the bells.
Kenta: Come on, the claw machine owes me a rematch.
===
title: Kenta_Hangout2
---
Kenta: I went to the underpass last night. Got about ten steps in.
Kenta: Darkest place I've ever been. My phone light did nothing.
-> You should have brought a real light.
    Kenta: That's the thing. I did. I just... ran.
-> Did you hear the bells?
    Kenta: ...Don't make me answer that.
Kenta: Take this. It's my old bike light. Brighter than it looks.
<<give flashlight>>
Kenta: If you go, you tell me everything. Deal?
===
title: Kenta_Hangout3
---
Kenta: Real talk. My brother used to tell me these stories. He moved to Tokyo and stopped calling.
Kenta: Chasing legends is kind of how I talk to him now. Weird, huh.
-> Not weird.
    Kenta: Thanks. Don't tell anyone I said that.
-> You should call him.
    Kenta: ...Yeah. Maybe I will.
<<flag kenta_confided>>
Kenta: Anyway! Rematch. The claw machine fears me now.
===
title: Kenta_HangoutAgain
---
Kenta: You came! The claw machine has been waiting.
You win a stuffed penguin neither of you wanted.
===
